#: ../../source/qqqr/up/captcha/capsess.rst:2
msgid "Captcha Sessions"
msgstr "验证码 Session"

#: of qqqr.up.captcha.capsess.BaseTcaptchaSession:1
msgid "Base class for all captcha sessions."
msgstr "所有验证码 session 的基类。"

#: of qqqr.up.captcha.capsess.BaseTcaptchaSession:3
msgid ""
"Holds captcha configuration, solves the PoW workload, fetches the TDC JavaScript, and dispatches"
" captcha problem solving to hooks. Subclasses implement :meth:`get_captcha_problem` and "
":meth:`solve_captcha`."
msgstr "保存验证码配置、解决 PoW 工作负载、获取 TDC JavaScript，并将验证码问题解决分发到钩子。子类实现 :meth:`get_captcha_problem` 和 :meth:`solve_captcha`。"

#: ../../source/qqqr/up/captcha/capsess.rst:9
msgid "Slide Captcha Session"
msgstr "滑动验证码 Session"

#: of qqqr.up.captcha.slide._types:1
msgid "Slide captcha types and session implementation."
msgstr "滑动验证码类型和 session 实现。"

#: of qqqr.up.captcha.slide._types:3
msgid "Models for slide-captcha render data and :class:`SlideCaptchaSession`."
msgstr "滑动验证码渲染数据的模型和 :class:`SlideCaptchaSession`。"

#: ../../source/qqqr/up/captcha/capsess.rst:13
msgid "Select Captcha Session"
msgstr "选择验证码 Session"

#: of qqqr.up.captcha.select._types:1
msgid "Select captcha types and session implementation."
msgstr "选择验证码类型和 session 实现。"

#: of qqqr.up.captcha.select._types:3
msgid ""
"Models for select-captcha render data and the :class:`SelectCaptchaSession` that orchestrates "
"problem fetching and solving via hooks."
msgstr "选择验证码渲染数据的模型和 :class:`SelectCaptchaSession`，它通过钩子协调问题获取和解决。"

